# libFuzzer dictionary for the cxxopts parser harness (test/fuzz.cpp).
# The harness feeds FuzzedDataProvider bytes that become option names + a synthetic argv; these
# tokens steer mutation toward the argv shapes cxxopts' parser branches on (long/short flags, the
# "=" inline value, the "--" end-of-options marker, grouped short flags, list separators).
"--"
"-"
"="
"--help"
"--version"
"-h"
"-v"
",-"
"--opt="
"-abc"
"--no-"
"true"
"false"
